tapnext_torch.py, tapnext_lru_modules.py and pscan.py are from
https://github.com/google-deepmind/tapnet, directory tapnet/tapnext/,
at commit 148b2c4090eb2e34551c46cf079be258ea41d175 (2026-07-09, "Support
variable resolutions and add VOTSp2026 submission files").

Changes for trackertools: package-relative imports instead of
`tapnet.tapnext`, and the einops rearranges replaced by the equivalent
torch reshape/permute calls (tapnext_torch.py, tapnext_lru_modules.py; each
file says so in its header); in tapnext_torch.py the torch.export / pytree
registrations (private torch API, unused here) may fail without stopping the
import. pscan.py is unchanged.

The TAPNext++ weights (tapnextpp_ckpt.pt, tapnextpp_512.ckpt; Apache-2.0,
from DeepMind's storage) are not part of this repository.

Paper: TAPNext++ (arXiv 2604.10582); TAPNext (arXiv 2504.05579).

